>> 3) Desde orders-api no es posible abrir una conexion a los consumidores
PS> docker compose exec orders-api node -e "require('net').connect(3000,'inventory-consumer').on('connect',()=>{console.log('inventory-consumer CONECTADO');process.exit(0)}).on('error',e=>{console.log('inventory-consumer sin conexion directa: '+e.code);process.exit(0)})"
inventory-consumer sin conexion directa: ECONNREFUSED
PS> docker compose exec orders-api node -e "require('net').connect(3000,'billing-consumer').on('connect',()=>{console.log('billing-consumer CONECTADO');process.exit(0)}).on('error',e=>{console.log('billing-consumer sin conexion directa: '+e.code);process.exit(0)})"
